  "_template_doc": {
    "title": "Task 2 — Full 27-Layer Co-Planar Dual-Rail PDN Design Template: LDA Compute (VDDC0..3 + VDD_0P8_SRAM_CC0..3 on U9, U12, U88, U10)",
    "how_to_use": [
      "1. Edit any parameter below (target LDA RefDes/nets, L01 SURFACE 3:1 Partial VIP + 15um Vertical C-Jog/S-Jog vs FULL mode, L01..L27 co-planar VDDC/SRAM split gaps & Dynamic/Static modes, 96-pin N24792-018 eDTC rules, Core PTH pitches, 9F->5F & 9B->5B stitch pitch, 8-via BGA octagon radius, or BASE curved recess & co-pocket 180-deg LSC rules).",
      "2. Compile & validate all 27 layers: python -m agent04_pdn_architect.templates.pdn_27layer_template_runner --config agent04_pdn_architect/templates/task2_vddc_sram_27layer_template.json",
      "3. Inspect generated SVGs + Layer Summary JSON in agent04_pdn_architect/reports/template_builds/task2_vddc_sram/, then run the generated *_run_apd_headless.bat (or add --build-mcm) to produce a new .mcm database."
    ]
  },
